：安全手机是您未来找回密码的依据，请使用自己本人的手机号）\n\n4、输入手机号后，请单击获取验证码，将手机收到验证码输入后点击下一步，设置好密码（密码必须包含大小写字母和 数字并长度不少于8位）\n\n5、显示下页后，账号激活成功，你可以使用账号继续访问学校系统了。\n\n服务人群：\n\n研究生,学校管理员,教师,兼职教师,学生\n\n所属部门：\n\n网络与信息化处\n\n服务日期：\n\n长期有效\n","review":{"body_sha256":"66baa2b618611d58dcb0d13a3e9101ae47594dab6af373bffd03e84f25edf475","checked_at":"2026-10-14","checked_by":"official-source-validator"},"title":"新生统一身份认证账号激活说明正文与服务条件","topic_id":"identity"}],"collected_at":"2026-10-14","collection_note":"用户保存的渲染 DOM；日期按日记载，不推测发布时间或采集时分。仅保留指南正文、公开通用服务元数据和指南图片；移除个人中心、表单与脚本。","collection_precision":"day","complete":true,"contains_personal_data":false,"content_kind":"guide","document_id":"portal-06","external_references":[],"item_code":"06","legacy_source_ids":[],"original_file":"documents/portal-06/original.html","provenance":{"guide_source":"iframe_saved_from_url","original_file_kind":"sanitized_guide_subtree","original_kind":"rendered_dom","publication_date_known":false,"retained_nodes":"title, item code, service-guide-item, service metadata","saved_file":"砚湖易办02_files/jz4wkfzkwprfemxbpppb84e6kbyk5dbr.html"},"published_on":null,"publisher":"网络与信息化处","service_entrances":[],"signed_on":null,"title":"新生统一身份认证账号激活说明","url":"https://bsdt.cdut.edu.cn/EIP/nonlogin/elobby/service/introduction/jz4wkfzkwprfemxbpppb84e6kbyk5dbr.htm"},{"access_scope":"authenticated_general","attachments":[],"body_file":"documents/portal-1042/body.txt","body_sha256":"2dc6428055bd5b7b97d980d5c3bfc90c191590cb8f94cef47f89763c676f4f9a","capture_assets":[{"asset_id":"image-a1be8e35136d7db396d1d896","file":"documents/portal-1042/assets/a1be8e35136d7db396d1d896.png","format":"png","local_ref":"./121581487d90408db26f5f36f44ba156.png","sha256":"a1be8e35136d7db396d1d896942ff99213c113e2a0c894efa5732ac0bd1b2b5c","source_url":null,"text_verified":false,"url_evidence":"browser_rewritten_local_reference_only"}],"capture_issues":[],"channel":"browser_dom","clauses":[{"aliases":"心理咨询预约 砚湖易办 服务指南","applicability":{"academic_year":null,"audience_quote":"